IDD_ABOUT_DIALOG DIALOGEX 0, 0, 308, 138
STYLE DS_SETFONT | DS_MODALFRAME | DS_3DLOOK | DS_CENTER | WS_POPUP | WS_VISIBLE | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU
CAPTION "About 2LabVnc Server"
